>subRepeatInterval</replaceable
>, 
                  int <replaceable
>subRepeatCount</replaceable
>)
</synopsis>
<synopsis
>bool scheduleFile(const QString&amp; <replaceable
>name</replaceable
>,
                  const QString&amp; <replaceable
>URL</replaceable
>,
